<i>- No, sir.</i>

439
00:30:38,087 --> 00:30:39,213
Are you sure?

440
00:30:39,296 --> 00:30:41,423
<i>Yes, sir. She's not in our records.</i>

441
00:30:41,507 --> 00:30:43,509
Okay. Okay.

442
00:30:44,093 --> 00:30:45,511
Thank you very much.

443
