514
00:35:28,293 --> 00:35:30,462
But you've been separated for a while.

515
00:35:30,546 --> 00:35:32,673
Don't you want
to take care of your sister?

516
00:35:32,756 --> 00:35:34,174
I do.

517
00:35:34,258 --> 00:35:35,926
But not here.

518
00:35:36,009 --> 00:35:38,178
I'll take care of her at the facility.

519
00:35:39,388 --> 00:35:40,722
Please trust me.

520
00:35:40,806 --> 00:35:43,100
- This is for your sake too.
- What a shame.

521
00:35:43,183 --> 00:35:44,601
I actually like it here.

522
00:35:45,185 --> 00:35:47,688
Your house is beautiful.
Your life is beautiful.

523
00:35:48,438 --> 00:35:51,483
Joel would've loved this.

524
00:35:52,484 --> 00:35:54,403
All this food?

525
00:35:55,195 --> 00:35:56,613
If only you hadn't killed him.

526
00:35:58,532 --> 00:36:00,576
Ging, we've already talked
about this, right?

527
00:36:02,494 --> 00:36:05,497
You said you'd take me to him.
Where is he?

528
00:36:05,581 --> 00:36:07,541
I don't know where he is, Ging.

529
00:36:07,624 --> 00:36:10,419
Or maybe you can't take me to him anymore
because you've killed him.

530
00:36:10,502 --> 00:36:12,379
